{"ticker":{"symbol":"004370.KS","name":"농심","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":366500.0,"change_pct":-0.044328552803129084,"market_cap":2138229964800.0,"pe":10.352023,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.01637107776261937,"week52_low":319000.0,"week52_high":480500.0,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":5463,"website":"https://www.nongshim.com","business_summary":"Nongshim Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, manufactures, sells, imports, and exports ramen, snacks, and beverages in Asia, the Americas, Europe, and Oceania. It also provides home meal replacements; and imports and markets brand products, such as Kellogg's cereals, Tulip canned meat, House Curry, Chupa Chups, Pringles, Mentos, jam, peanut butter, Lindt chocolates, and Villa Blanca oil. The company was formerly known as Lotte Industrial Company and changed its name to Nongshim Co., Ltd. in March 1978. Nongshim Co., Ltd. was founded in 1965 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"(주)농심은 자회사와 함께 아시아, 미주, 유럽, 오세아니아 지역에서 라면, 스낵, 음료 등을 제조, 판매, 수입, 수출하고 있습니다. 또한 집에서 식사를 대체할 수도 있습니다. 켈로그 시리얼, 튤립 통조림 고기, 하우스카레, 츄파춥스, 프링글스, 멘토스, 잼, 땅콩버터, 린트 초콜릿, 빌라블랑카 오일 등 브랜드 제품을 수입, 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 롯데산업주식회사로 알려져 있었고 1978년 3월에 농심주식회사로 상호를 변경했습니다. 농심주식회사는 1965년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":3769598420000.0,"rev_lo":3709000000000.0,"rev_hi":3837648690000.0,"rev_g":0.3784,"n":15,"eps":34129.227,"eps_lo":26642.227,"eps_hi":37621.5,"eps_g":0.2202},{"period":"2027","rev":3942865840000.0,"rev_lo":3748000000000.0,"rev_hi":4079300000000.0,"rev_g":0.3736,"n":16,"eps":35403.707,"eps_lo":29964.81,"eps_hi":38377.83,"eps_g":0.0373}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"가공식품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":3129065208080.0,"operating_income":112172857000.0,"net_income":116122101150.0,"eps":20081.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":3410559367250.0,"operating_income":2120